  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smart Grid Investment Roadmap, through Quanta Technology, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Smart Grid Investment Roadmap Technical Assistance will support the Panamanian energy ministry&apos;s efforts to develop a regulatory framework that would advance the deployment of smart grid technologies in the country. The project will foster smart grid technology investments that would accommodate new renewable sources of energy, improve the reliability of the power grid, and expand energy efficiency management.</narrative>
